---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Primordial Nucleosynthesis Cheat Sheet | Free BBN, Light Elements, Deuterium"
  description="Complete primordial nucleosynthesis cheat sheet with BBN, light elements, and deuterium. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Primordial Nucleosynthesis<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>BBN, light elements, and deuterium. From neutrons to the first atoms.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>BBN Process</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Timeline</h3>
        <pre><code>t ~ 1 s: neutron-proton freeze-out
t ~ 3 min: deuterium forms
t ~ 10 min: helium forms
t ~ 20 min: nucleosynthesis ends
Duration: ~ 20 minutes</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Light Elements</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Abundances</h3>
        <table>
          <tr><th>Element</th><th>Abundance</th><th>Observation</th></tr>
          <tr><td>¹H</td><td>75%</td><td>75%</td></tr>
          <tr><td>⁴He</td><td>24.8%</td><td>25%</td></tr>
          <tr><td>D</td><td>2.5 × 10⁻⁵</td><td>2-3 × 10⁻⁵</td></tr>
          <tr><td>³He</td><td>10⁻⁵</td><td>10⁻⁵</td></tr>
          <tr><td>⁷Li</td><td>5 × 10⁻¹⁰</td><td>10⁻¹⁰ (lithium problem)</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Key Physics</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Freeze-Out</h3>
        <pre><code>Neutron-proton ratio: n/p = exp(-Δm/T)
Δm = 1.293 MeV (mass difference)
T ~ 1 MeV: freeze-out (t ~ 1 s)
n/p ~ 1/7 at freeze-out</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Bottlenecks</h3>
        <pre><code>Deuterium bottleneck: D photodissociation
Mass-5 gap: no stable A=5 nucleus
Mass-8 gap: no stable A=8 nucleus
Only light elements formed</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Constraints</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>BBN Constraints</h3>
        <pre><code>Number of neutrino species: N_ν ≈ 3
Baryon-to-photon ratio: η ≈ 6 × 10⁻¹⁰
Ω_b h² ≈ 0.022 (from deuterium)
He abundance constrains expansion rate</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
